//! Stage 4 compositor & GPU-indirection integration and Risk 4 protocol tests:
//! - Risk 4: 1-in-flight `CommitTracker`, idempotent `RetainedLayerStore` replay & keyframe resync,
//!   `EpochRetirementQueue` deferred destruction, and `Atlas` epoch pinning.
//! - Compositor animations, Scroll/Pointer timelines, sub-stepped springs, and zero-poll idle.
//! - Full scroll physics: touch pan + exponential fling, `overscroll-behavior` (`Auto`/`Contain`/`None`),
//!   scroll snap (`Mandatory`, `Proximity`, `stopAlways`), smooth scroll cancel, thumb drag.
//! - `EnginePool` parallel glyph, path, and icon raster parity + `UiTree` frame CPU pixel parity.
